# This directory holds a LIVE Supabase session: user.json contains an access
# token AND a refresh token for the end-to-end test account, and status.json
# names the workspace it belongs to. Committing either would publish working
# credentials.
#
# Self-contained here rather than in the root .gitignore so the protection
# travels with the directory it protects and cannot be lost to an unrelated
# edit of a file at the repository root.
*
!.gitignore
